<title>USA: Osmonics says shares sold at $21.50/shr.</title>
<headline>Osmonics says shares sold at $21.50/shr.</headline>
<dateline>MINNETONKA, Minn. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Osmonics Inc said Wednesday that certain shareholders sold 482,806 shares of the water equipment company at $21.50 a share.</p>
<p>The sellers included a long-term investor and and individuals from recently acquired Desalination Systems Inc.</p>
<p>The company said it sold no shares.</p>
<p>Osmonics sahres closed up 1/4 at 21-3/4 Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
